                <p className="text-[#555] leading-relaxed text-sm">{"You are placing your faith in your own effort instead of in God's provision. Outcomes do not come from how hard you work. A CEO works fewer hours than you but earns more. The difference is where faith is placed. Faith connects you to God's supply. Effort alone cannot. Stop trying to earn what God offers as a gift. Renew your mind through daily prayer and scripture, reconnect to God, and receive what He has already promised."}</p>
