                <p className="text-[#555] leading-relaxed text-sm">{"You are experiencing signal loss. Faith comes by hearing and hearing by the word of God. You must reconnect daily through prayer and by reading scripture. Attend church in person when you can, not just online, because the testimony of others reconnects your faith. The further you drift from daily prayer, Bible reading, and community, the weaker your connection becomes. It is not that God has moved. Your router just needs fixing. Reconnect every day."}</p>
